{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中共二十屆五中全會，一連四天在北京舉行。</p><p></p><p>相信是開幕會場的海淀區京西賓館，外圍有不少公安及交警戒備，普通車輛未能駛進該區域。附近一帶亦保安嚴密，多個路口設有路障，並有警員駐守。</p><p></p><p>央視報道，會議的主要議程是中共中央政治局向中央委員會報告工作，研究持之以恆推進全面從嚴治黨若干重大問題。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:23.490637+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.353757+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:37.370987+00:00","content_hash":"5b7bbe19bc4ac1726864b811e4e5b00e3b637c222b54b05d9d2fe589fd5dddcf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:23.490637+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}